<title>POLAND: POLAND OFFERS PLN 300 MLN 3-YR BONDS ON AUG 20.</title>
<headline>POLAND OFFERS PLN 300 MLN 3-YR BONDS ON AUG 20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will offer 300 million zlotys floating three-year Treasury bonds at a primary tender on August 20, 1997, the central bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bonds mature on August 6, 2000, and the auction's value date is August 26, 1997. Investor bids at the auction must be placed by 1100 local time (0900 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
